diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 5c99772..44d3005 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -78,3 +78,20 @@ These are algorithmic improvements, not a claim of parity with CamScanner. Test
   - Added text line gradient variance detector (`detectSidewaysOrientation`) that automatically detects and straightens 90-degree sideways captures during crop confirmation.
 - **Print-Safe Margins (`PdfWriter.kt`):**
   - Added standard 12 pt safe margins on standardized A4 exports, preventing physical printers from clipping document headers and footers.
+
+
+## v2.7.0 - straight pages, soft ink (Imaging.kt)
+- **Post-warp straightening (`straighten`)**: after the perspective warp, the slope of the text lines / rules is measured in 6 horizontal
+  bands (projection-profile search on a small copy), a line is fitted through the band angles and one homography removes the
+  residual rotation *and* keystone. Unsure (little text, angle at the search limit) -> page left unchanged. Test photo: lines went
+  from ~3 deg (top) / ~1 deg (bottom) off to < 0.4 deg everywhere.
+  Limit: only horizontal structure is measured; a vertical lean caused by a bad corner quad is not corrected - adjust the corners.
+- **`MAGIC` is now continuous** (`FilterMode.MAGIC`): one tone curve on luminance + the pixel's own chroma boosted x2.8 and faded to
+  zero towards paper. The old hard ink / halo / paper branches cut the anti-aliased edges of pen strokes (thick, ragged, posterised
+  handwriting). Sharpening for MAGIC is luminance-only with a +-4 level overshoot clamp (no grey fringe on coloured ink).
+  Constants: `MAGIC_BLACK`, `MAGIC_WHITE`, `MAGIC_CHROMA`.
+- **`trimBorders`**: also trims clearly coloured strips (pink folder, cloth) relative to the page colour, up to 8% per side.
+- Known: a large cast shadow that is bigger than the illumination filter (e.g. a phone shadow over the page bottom) is still not
+  fully flattened; automatic corner detection can pick up neighbouring white sheets in a cluttered scene.
+- References/tests: `tools/prototype/v2_7/` (Python), `tools/jvmtest/` (runs the real Kotlin on a PC). Compiled and run on a PC with
+  stubs; not yet compiled/tested with the Android SDK or on a device.
