+  java -Xmx2g -jar t.jar photo.jpg out.png MAGIC auto                      # app's own corner detection
+  java -Xmx2g -jar t.jar photo.jpg out.png MAGIC "x0,y0,x1,y1,x2,y2,x3,y3"  # corners in pixels TL,TR,BR,BL
+The stubs are only for testing (bilinear resampling approximates Android's); never part of the app build.
