+v2.7.0 reference (Python, same maths as Imaging.kt):
+  straighten()  text-line slope per band -> linear fit -> one homography (rotation + keystone)
+  trim()        non-paper strips (dark OR coloured) along the border
+  magic()       soft continuous colour-preserving filter (tone curve on luminance, boosted chroma faded to 0 on paper)
+Needs: numpy, opencv-python.
